                                Parish church of St Botulph</orgName>
                            <p>For the Beinecke fragment of the Iken Psalter, see Raymond Clemens,
                                Diane Ducharme, and Emily Ulrich, <title>A gathering of medieval
                                    English manuscripts: the Takamiya collection at the Beinecke
                                    Library</title> ([New Haven], 2017), p. 45.</p>
                            <p>For a discussion of the Iken Psalter more broadly, including the
                                evidence for the Iken attribution and the context for later
                                fragmentation and dispersal, see the record for <ref
                                    target="https://mlgb.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/catalog/book_8733">Ohio
                                    State University, Thompson Library, MS
                                    MR.Frag.60.1</ref>. Further
                                fragments of the Iken Psalter are listed under <ref
                                    target="https://mlgb.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/catalog/org_863">Iken
                                    Parish church</ref>.</p></provenance>
